    "Id": "vehicledef_VISOR_D",
    "Name": "Visor D",
    "Details": "The D configuration of the Visor Strike Vehicle imitates the common Puller variant that is built around lift hoists, and it mounts four Lift Hoists of its own. Its only weapon is a hidden Clan Laser AMS in the turret. Together with the C configuration, it is one of the few configurations that Society logistics personnel are allowed to use.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 8/12 hexes / 240/360 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous (C)\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       155     20\n<b>Left</b>         120     20\n<b>Right</b>       120     20\n<b>Rear</b>        120     20\n<b>Turret</b>      120     20\n\n<b>Total</b>      635    100</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Easy to Maintain</color>",
